            <div id="waldo-tag-banner" role="presentation"></div>
                    
        <main id="site-main" class="site-main">
            <div class="container p-3 mt-3 mb-4 border shadow-sm">
                <div class="rich-v2 modern  clearfix" data-title="" data-url="/camps">
            <div class="article-body clearfix">
    <div class="container-fluid p-0">
        <div class="article-data d-flex  flex-row flex-sm-row  justify-content-between">
            <div class="article-data-inner position-relative w-100">
                                                <div class="article-info d-flex flex-column flex-lg-row gap-4 position-relative">
                    <div class="article-info-main flex-fill">
                        <div class="article-details mb-3">
                            <div class="article-post-metrics d-flex justify-content-start">
    <div class="article-post-metrics-box-1">
            
    </div>
    <div class="article-post-metrics-box-1">
            

    </div>
</div>

                                                                                

                                                    
            
                                
                                
                                
                        </div>
                                                    <div class="article-content">
                            <h3 style="text-align: center;"><strong><a href="/sports/bsb/2019-20/2020_FSW_Baseball_Camps">Baseball Camps</a>&nbsp; |&nbsp; <a href="/x/9zvdb" target="_self">Softball Camps</a>&nbsp; |&nbsp; <a href="/camps-mbb">Men's Basketball Camps</a>&nbsp; |&nbsp; <a href="/x/kwi1h" target="_self">Women's Basketball Camps&nbsp;</a></strong></h3>
<h3 style="text-align: center;"><strong>|&nbsp; <a href="/camps_copy/FSW_Volleyball_Camps">Volleyball Camps</a></strong></h3>
<h3 style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;</h3>
<h2>FAQs</h2>
<p>The information below is provided for your reference. Florida SouthWestern Athletic Camps and clinics are held and managed by the individual sports and its. For any questions about specific camps, please click on the sport you are interested in, and you will find contact information of the lead for each camp.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Are camps open to boys and girls of all ages?</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Ages/grades and other enrollment requirements vary camp to camp. 
<ul>
<li>Please refer to each camp's web page for details.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Do I have to pay the full camp fee at the time of registration?</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>All camps require payment at the time of online registration. 
<ul>
<li>Once your registration form is submitted you will be re-directed to a payment screen for the selected camps.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Should a camp registration not be paid at the time of registration and an indvidudal arrives at the start of camp, unpaid, they will be required to make a credit card payment only at the camp site. 
<ul>
<li>No cash or checks will be accepted.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>When do you stop accepting registrations for camps?</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Registration generally remains open until a camp fills, and all camp registrations are processed in the order in which they are received.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Do camps offer any discounts on the registration fees?</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>At this time multi-camp/sibling discounts are not offered.&nbsp;</li>
<li>In the future, should discounts be offered, information will be found on each teams respective camp page.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>What Is the Refund Policy for Camps?</strong></p>
<ul type="disc">
<li>All requests for refunds must be made by emailing Justin Long, Director of Business Operations, Athletics at <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#157f6066617c7b3b797a7b72557366623b707160"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="aac0dfd9dec3c484c6c5c4cdeaccd9dd84cfcedf">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>.</li>
<li>All registration fee(s) paid with the exception of a 25% administrative fee (of the original registration fee), per session enrolled, will be refunded provided the notice of cancellation is received 14 days prior to the start of camp.</li>
<li>No refunds will be provided less than 14 days prior to camp, for expulsion from camp, for voluntary withdrawal from camp, or for injuries sustained prior to camp or at camp.</li>
<li>We are also unable to issue a credit for any future camps.</li>
</ul>
<div id="_mcePaste" class="mcePaste" style="position: absolute; left: -10000px; top: 0px; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden;">
<p class="MsoNormal">Are camps open to boys and girls of all ages?<br>

 Ages/grades and other enrollment requirements vary camp to camp. You may refer to each camp's web page for details.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Do I have to pay the full camp fee at the time of registration?<br>

 All camps require a payment at the time of registration. <span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';">Please submit payment with your registration form to:</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';">Florida SouthWestern State College<br>

 Athletics, Building I-119<br>

 8099 College Parkway<br>

 Fort Myers, FL 33919</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';">Checks need to be made Payable to: Florida SouthWestern State College</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';">If you would like to pay with a debit or credit card, you will need to pay at the FSW Cashier&rsquo;s Office on Lee Campus. For more information on the payment method you can email <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#5033313d2023103623277e353425"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="d7b4b6baa7a497b1a4a0f9b2b3a2">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal">When do you stop accepting registrations for camps?<br>

 Registration is generally open until a camp fills, and all camp registrations are processed in the order in which they are received.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Do camps offer any discounts on the registration fees?<br>

 Some camps do offer discounts, such as for groups, UM employees, sibling discounts, multi-camp discounts, etc. You may refer to each camp's web page for discount information or contact the Camp Director with any questions.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal">What is the refund policy?<br>

 All requests for refunds must be made by emailing <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#ed8e8c809d9ead8b9e9ac3888998"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="8cefede1fcffcceafffba2e9e8f9">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>. All monies paid with the exception of a $50.00 administrative fee, per session enrolled, will be refunded provided the notice of cancellation is received 14 days prior to the start of camp. No refunds will be provided less than 14 days prior to camp, for expulsion from camp, for voluntary withdrawal from camp, or for injuries sustained prior to camp or at camp. We are also unable to issue a credit for any future camps.</p>
<!-- [if gte mso 9]><xml> <o:OfficeDocumentSettings> <o:AllowPNG /> </o:OfficeDocumentSettings> </xml><![endif]-->
<p class="MsoNormal">Are camps open to boys and girls of all ages?<br>

 Ages/grades and other enrollment requirements vary camp to camp. You may refer to each camp's web page for details.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Do I have to pay the full camp fee at the time of registration?<br>

